<title>FINLAND: Finland fin min says ERM link boosts stability.</title>
<headline>Finland fin min says ERM link boosts stability.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's finance minister Sauli Niinisto said on Monday that the weekend decision to link the markka to Europe's Exchange Rate Mechanism (ERM) would mean more stability and confidence in the economy.</p>
<p>&quot;We feel that linking brings even more stability, more confidence towards our economy,&quot; Niinisto said in an interview with Reuters Financial Television.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0247</p>
